most negative effects from the caster. Radius: %replenish_radius% Dispel Type: Basic Dispel Passive: Guardian Aura Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration and %aura_mana_regen% mana regeneration to allied units. Radius: %aura_radius% Movement speed bonuses from multiple pairs of boots do not stack.", "notes_loc": ["Mend does not affect units that have been affected by Mend or Mekansm Restore within Guardian Greaves' cooldown."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "item_cost", "old": 4450, "new": 4350}, {"field": "add_nostack_debuff", "old": null, "new": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "aura_bonus_threshold", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "aura_health_regen_bonus", "old": {"base": [14.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "bonus_movement", "old": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [55], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "2c124b4496b0e89661ca", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "fffe110a38a1091ff123", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "59a6902103cbbbcd0fdf", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "62a813f6e3fa1f91694a", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "64dfa12adf518896c095", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "352ddc0da611d80080eb", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b0e1cb33818b1a6e36d5", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "gungir", "name_zh": "缚灵索", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Eternal Chains Roots all enemies in a %radius_tooltip% radius for %duration% seconds.", "notes_loc": ["AoE bonuses from multiple Chasm Stones or its upgrades do not stack."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Eternal Chains Roots all enemies in the target area for %duration%s. Radius: %radius_tooltip%", "notes_loc": ["AoE bonuses from multiple Chasm Stones or its upgrades do not stack."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [18], "new": [17]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [18], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [17], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_aoe", "old": {"base": [75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [60], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_intellect", "old": {"base": [12], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "radius", "old": {"base": [325], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [340], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "66a4bb8f5866bbc981fa", "mechanism": "root", "mechanism_zh": "缠绕", "definition": "目标不能移动，闪烁和传送类也不能用，但仍能攻击和施法", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_afterburner", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·加力燃烧器", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Gyrocopter gains movement speed for a short duration after damaging an enemy with his attacks or abilities."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Gyrocopter gains movement speed for a short duration after damaging an enemy with his attacks or abilities.", "notes_loc": ["Break disables the gaining of new stacks.", "Break does not disable the bonuses from existing stacks."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "1de50338bb265c60470f", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "2344af7eacbb461e1bc3", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "70892279d3524b707add", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition": "提升自身、自己的单位或友方的移动速度（顺带加一点移速的也算）；只让敌人变慢的不算", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_call_down", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·召唤飞弹", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Call down %total_strikes% aerial missile strikes that slow and damage enemy units in a target area. Each strike is %strike_separation% distance from the previous one.", "notes_loc": ["The visual indicator is visible to allies only."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Call down %total_strikes% aerial missile strikes that slow and damage enemy units in a target area. Each strike is %strike_separation% distance from the previous one.", "notes_loc": ["The visual indicator is visible to allies only."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "radius", "old": {"base": [400], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [425], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "0e4ed3d3e03001f18679", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "348d0e1efd4b96685cf3", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_flak_cannon", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·高射火炮", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Gyrocopter's attacks hit all enemy units in an area around it for a limited number of attacks. Only the main target of attacks will receive attack bonuses such as Critical Strike. Lasts %abilityduration% seconds or until the attacks are used.", "notes_loc": ["Attack range for the primary attack is unchanged."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Gyrocopter's attacks hit all enemy units in an area around it for a limited number of attacks. The additional attacks can proc attack modifiers at reduced effectiveness, except for Lifesteal and Critical Strike. Lasts %abilityduration% seconds or until the attacks are used.", "notes_loc": ["Attack range for the primary attack is unchanged."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "attack_effectiveness", "old": null, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_damage", "old": {"base": [], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "radius", "old": {"base": [1250], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1050], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "3366bea3e838d5e55a61", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3ac2f189ccf9f8b69402", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "audit:gyrocopter_flak_cannon:cleave:base", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "c010bb8217fb3876e2af", "mechanism": "critical", "mechanism_zh": "暴击", "definition": "攻击造成额外倍数伤害；有概率触发或强化下一次攻击都算", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_homing_missile", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·追踪导弹", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Fires a homing missile to seek the targeted enemy unit. The missile gains speed over time, dealing damage and stunning when it impacts the target. Enemy units can destroy the missile before it reaches its target.", "notes_loc": ["Towers do half damage to the missile.", "The crosshair effect is visible to allies only.", "The missile will follow and hit invisible units."], "shard_loc": "Homing Missiles now constantly fires the current level of Rocket Barrage in a %shard_radius% area of effect after %shard_delay% second of being cast. This Rocket Barrage prioritizes the Homing Missile target."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Fires a homing missile to seek the targeted enemy unit. The missile gains speed over time, dealing damage and stunning when it impacts the target. Enemy units can destroy the missile before it reaches its target.", "notes_loc": ["Creeps and illusions deal 25% damage to the missile.", "The crosshair effect is visible to allies only.", "The missile will follow and hit invisible units."], "shard_loc": "Homing Missiles now constantly fires the current level of Rocket Barrage in a %shard_radius% area of effect after %shard_delay% second of being cast. This Rocket Barrage prioritizes the Homing Missile target."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "hero_damage", "old": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "hits_to_kill", "old": null, "new": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "tower_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "old": {"base": [6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:gyrocopter_homing_missile:aoe_damage:shard", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "shard_upgrade", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "5a90af549b38cde0c6dd", "mechanism": "invisibility", "mechanism_zh": "隐身", "definition": "使自身、队友、召唤物或复制体隐身", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "9665c4d37f5684ffd5b9", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "82187ec539ac9a9806a3", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "gyrocopter_side_gunner_spawn_ability", "name_zh": "矮人直升机·侧翼机枪", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Gyrocopter gains a Side Gunner that attacks enemy units in a %AbilityCastRange% unit radius every %sidegunner_fire_rate%s with his attack. Prioritizes furthest unit away within its range.", "notes_loc": ["Side Gunner can attack even while Gyrocopter is disabled."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Gyrocopter gains a Side Gunner that attacks enemy units in a %AbilityCastRange% unit radius every %sidegunner_fire_rate%s with his attack. Prioritizes furthest unit away within its range.", "notes_loc": ["Side Gunner can attack even while Gyrocopter is disabled."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "attack_effectiveness", "old": null, "new": {"base": [75], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "2653d77b71ac51c80a3e", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "b984d31b20d8dc116132", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "harpoon", "name_zh": "鱼叉", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Draw Forth When targeting an enemy, fire a harpoon at them, that pulls you and the target closer together, up to %pull_distance_pct%%% of the distance between you and your target. If the caster is melee, the hero and target are always pulled to within melee distance of each other. Targeting a tree always pulls you all the way to that tree. Passive: Echo Strike Causes melee attacks to attack twice in quick succession. The double attacks apply a %movement_slow%%% movement slow for %slow_duration% seconds on the first strike. Echo Strike cooldown: %passive_cooldown%s"}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Draw Forth When targeting an enemy, fire a harpoon at them, that pulls you and the target closer together, up to %pull_distance_pct%%% of the distance between you and your target. If the caster is melee, the hero and target are always pulled to within melee distance of each other. Targeting a tree always pulls you all the way to that tree. Passive: Echo Strike Causes melee attacks to attack twice in quick succession. The double attacks apply a %movement_slow%%% movement slow for %slow_duration% seconds on the first strike. Echo Strike cooldown: %passive_cooldown%s", "notes_loc": ["Attack Range bonuses from Dragon Lance and its upgrades do not stack."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "base_attack_range_melee", "old": null, "new": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_agility", "old": {"base": [10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_intellect", "old": {"base": [10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "bonus_mana_regen", "old": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [2.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_strength", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:harpoon:attack_modifier:item", "mechanism": "attack_modifier", "mechanism_zh": "攻击特效", "definition": "让普通攻击附带额外效果：减甲、减速、减疗、烧蓝、额外伤害、中毒、降低属性等；有概率触发或只强化下一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "ea3a147e74d3fefd74b7", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "29524114ea1e9d0de1be", "mechanism": "mana_gain", "mechanism_zh": "自身回蓝/吸蓝", "definition": "为自己恢复或从其他单位抽取法力（如莱恩法力吸取），含属性回蓝和回蓝倍率；对友军生效且能给自己回蓝的也算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:harpoon:self_mobility:item", "mechanism": "self_mobility", "mechanism_zh": "自身位移", "definition": "闪烁、冲刺、跳跃、传送等主动改变自身位置", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "47c2206be795a384212f", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:harpoon:terrain_walk:item", "mechanism": "terrain_walk", "mechanism_zh": "无视地形", "definition": "移动时不受悬崖等不可通行地形阻挡，也能穿过树木", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "headdress", "name_zh": "恢复头巾", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Regeneration Aura Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration to allies. Radius: %aura_radius%"}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Passive: Regeneration Aura Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration to allied player units. Radius: %aura_radius%"}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "c25832388aefc2ef35a0", "mechanism": "aura", "mechanism_zh": "光环", "definition": "跟着单位持续影响周围单位；对友军或敌方都算，并记作用对象；固定在地上的区域归场地魔法", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b8c8c99076b3d0c29f51", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "heavens_halberd", "name_zh": "天堂之戟", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Disarm Prevents a target from attacking for %disarm_melee% seconds."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Disarm Prevents a target from attacking for %disarm_melee% seconds."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_ranges", "old": [750], "new": [500]}, {"field": "mana_costs", "old": [25], "new": [50]}, {"field": "item_cost", "old": 3300, "new": 2400}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [750], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [500], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "AbilityManaCost", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [50], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_armor", "old": {"base": [9], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [4.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_evasion", "old": {"base": [25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": null}, {"field": "bonus_health_regen", "old": {"base": [6.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [4.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "bonus_strength", "old": null, "new": {"base": [12], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "disarm_melee", "old": {"base": [3.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "disarm_range", "old": {"base": [3.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [3], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "78dbbc497a3bd53678ea", "mechanism": "disarm", "mechanism_zh": "缴械", "definition": "目标无法普通攻击", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:heavens_halberd:evasion:item", "mechanism": "evasion", "mechanism_zh": "闪避", "definition": "自身有概率使敌方攻击落空", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:heavens_halberd:healing:item", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "helm_of_the_dominator", "name_zh": "支配头盔", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Dominate Takes control of one neutral, non-ancient target unit and sets its movement speed to %speed_base% and max health to a minimum of %health_min%. Also provides the unit with +%creep_bonus_damage% base attack damage, +%creep_bonus_hp_regen% health regen, +%creep_bonus_mp_regen% mana regen and +%creep_bonus_armor% armor. Dominated units with a max health of greater than %health_min% retain their original max health. Grants the caster %bounty_pct%%% of the gold and experience bounty of the dominated creep. Dominated unit's bounty is set to %bounty_gold% gold and it can no longer be killed by abilities that instantly kill creeps otherwise. The Helm cannot be used for %creep_damage_taken_cooldown% seconds after the dominated creep takes damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_loc": ["Cannot dominate more than one unit at a time. If a new unit is dominated, the old one will die.", "Can also Dominate enemy lane creeps and summoned units.", "Selling Helm of the Dominator will cause dominated units to die."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Dominate Takes control of one neutral, non-ancient target unit and sets its movement speed to %speed_base% and max health to a minimum of %health_min%. Also provides the unit with +%creep_bonus_damage% base attack damage, +%creep_bonus_hp_regen% health regen, +%creep_bonus_mp_regen% mana regen and +%creep_bonus_armor% armor. Dominated units with a max health of greater than %health_min% retain their original max health. Grants the caster %bounty_pct%%% of the gold and experience bounty of the dominated creep. Dominated unit's bounty is set to %bounty_gold% gold and it can no longer be killed by abilities that instantly kill creeps otherwise. The Helm cannot be used for %creep_damage_taken_cooldown% seconds after the dominated creep takes damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_loc": ["Cannot dominate more than one unit at a time. If a new unit is dominated, the old one will die.", "Can also Dominate enemy lane creeps and summoned units.", "Selling Helm of the Dominator will cause dominated units to die."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "f1429b8fc5be43061c17", "mechanism": "economy", "mechanism_zh": "经济经验", "definition": "提供额外金钱或经验；只是正常赏金不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "31c6810518318cb074b0", "mechanism": "execute", "mechanism_zh": "斩杀", "definition": "目标低于生命阈值时直接杀死", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "841d73dbbce0084f6b3a", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0342558056273d648be5", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "2967d0d6cdd8356ecbaa", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "helm_of_the_overlord", "name_zh": "统御头盔", "category": "5_增删或退出", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Active: Dominate Takes control of one neutral target unit and sets its movement speed to %speed_base% and max health to a minimum of %health_min%. Also provides the unit with +%creep_bonus_damage% base attack damage, +%creep_bonus_hp_regen% health regen, +%creep_bonus_mp_regen% mana regen, +%creep_bonus_armor% armor, and levels up some abilities of the target by 1 level. Dominated units with a max health of greater than %health_min% retain their original max health. Grants the caster the gold and experience bounty of the dominated creep. Dominated unit's bounty is set to %bounty_gold% gold and it can no longer be killed by abilities that instantly kill creeps otherwise. The Helm cannot be used for %creep_damage_taken_cooldown% seconds after the dominated creep takes damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_loc": ["Can also Dominate enemy lane creeps and summoned units.", "Selling will cause dominated units to die."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Active: Dominate Takes control of one neutral target unit and sets its movement speed to %speed_base% and max health to a minimum of %health_min%. Also provides the unit with +%creep_bonus_damage% base attack damage, +%creep_bonus_hp_regen% health regen, +%creep_bonus_mp_regen% mana regen, +%creep_bonus_armor% armor, and levels up some abilities of the target by 1 level. Dominated units with a max health of greater than %health_min% retain their original max health. Grants the caster the gold and experience bounty of the dominated creep. Dominated unit's bounty is set to %bounty_gold% gold and it can no longer be killed by abilities that instantly kill creeps otherwise. The Helm cannot be used for %creep_damage_taken_cooldown% seconds after the dominated creep takes damage from an enemy hero or Roshan.", "notes_loc": ["Can also Dominate enemy lane creeps and summoned units.", "Selling will cause dominated units to die."]}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "3e43598f60b570e9fa32", "mechanism": "economy", "mechanism_zh": "经济经验", "definition": "提供额外金钱或经验；只是正常赏金不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "da0db8818641c2b5a3f4", "mechanism": "execute", "mechanism_zh": "斩杀", "definition": "目标低于生命阈值时直接杀死", "condition": "item", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "41067bd31b1da3d75367", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "366f91bfbf88067d5fce", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "b1944e5b73c41481ad7d", "mechanism": "summons", "mechanism_zh": "召唤物", "definition": "召唤有血量的单位（可控或不可控都算），以及夺取已有单位的控制权；按受攻击次数计算的单位和死亡守卫不算", "condition": "item", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_bushwhack", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·野地奇袭", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Tosses a net trap that stuns enemies if they are near a tree in the area. Affected enemies take damage over time and are pulled towards the tree nearest to them within the target area, and have their vision reduced to 0 for the duration of the stun.", "notes_loc": ["Units can be freed from the stun by destroying the tree.", "Bushwhack does not hit invisible units."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Tosses a net trap that stuns enemies if they are near a tree in the area. Affected enemies take damage over time and are pulled towards the tree nearest to them within the target area, and have their vision reduced to 0 for the duration of the stun.", "notes_loc": ["Units can be freed from the stun by destroying the tree.", "Bushwhack does not hit invisible units."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_ranges", "old": [1100], "new": [1000]}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [1100], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "debuff_duration", "old": {"base": [1.5, 1.7, 1.9, 2.1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1.4, 1.6, 1.8, 2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "projectile_speed", "old": {"base": [1300], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1200], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "trap_radius", "old": {"base": [265], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [275], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "b731fa1d6ae6d7ddac5f", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "af16518a0fa2aa452c45", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:hoodwink_bushwhack:reduce_vision:base", "mechanism": "reduce_vision", "mechanism_zh": "减视野", "definition": "降低目标的视野", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "f9cfb0399c4f99c3980e", "mechanism": "stun", "mechanism_zh": "眩晕", "definition": "使目标无法行动和施法的硬控（含小眩晕）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "07ed59bef8f70ea550d6", "mechanism": "tree_destroy", "mechanism_zh": "砍树", "definition": "能摧毁树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_hunters_boomerang", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·猎手旋镖", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Tosses a boomerang in an arc. Upon contact, it returns to Hoodwink. The boomerang will deal damage as it passes through or hits enemies, and apply a debuff that causes affected enemies to be slowed and be more vulnerable to spell damage."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Tosses a boomerang in an arc. Upon contact, it returns to Hoodwink. The boomerang will deal damage as it passes through or hits enemies, and apply a debuff that causes affected enemies to be slowed and be more vulnerable to spell damage."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "spell_amp", "old": {"base": [20], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "647dd73305fe230c9c3c", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0797b31b668492985f7f", "mechanism": "incoming_damage_amp", "mechanism_zh": "伤害加深", "definition": "让目标受到更多物理伤害或全部伤害（只加深魔法的归上一项）", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "af3bafb8d066210de34f", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "de96e73d336c1ff7795f", "mechanism": "slow", "mechanism_zh": "减速", "definition": "降低敌方单位的移动速度", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "d0134f244996b2e052e7", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "981117f873e10ea72359", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_mistwoods_wayfarer", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·林渊旅人", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Hoodwink has a chance to redirect enemy attacks to a nearby tree.", "notes_loc": ["Trees that take a redirected attack are destroyed."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Hoodwink has a chance to redirect enemy attacks to a nearby tree.", "notes_loc": ["Trees that take a redirected attack are destroyed."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "behavior", "old": "13194139533378", "new": "567347999932483"}, {"field": "redirect_chance", "old": {"base": [14.25], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "ede6e76a4756d9a46b84", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:hoodwink_mistwoods_wayfarer:evasion:base", "mechanism": "evasion", "mechanism_zh": "闪避", "definition": "自身有概率使敌方攻击落空", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "audit:hoodwink_mistwoods_wayfarer:tree_destroy:base", "mechanism": "tree_destroy", "mechanism_zh": "砍树", "definition": "能摧毁树木", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "hoodwink_scurry", "name_zh": "森海飞霞·密林奔走", "category": "3_说明文字", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Hoodwink gains bonus movement speed, phased movement, and tree-walking for a brief time. While active, the redirect chance of Mistwoods Wayfarer is multiplied by %evasion_multiplier%.", "facets_loc": ["Scurry also provides bonus attack and cast range."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Hoodwink gains bonus movement speed, phased movement, and tree-walking for a brief time.", "facets_loc": ["Scurry also provides bonus attack and cast range."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "evasion_multiplier", "old": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "movement_speed_pct", "old": {"base": [15, 20, 25, 30], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [20, 24, 28, 32], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "95d4ddb7577687b13971", "mechanism": "evasion", "mechanism_zh": "闪避", "definition": "自身有概率使敌方攻击落空", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "6dd4323b6f8b16bf9fc5", "mechanism": "haste", "mechanism_zh": "加速", "definition